I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no filesystem or HTTP import. The metadata fetch would also send each customer's question to an external host. If operations needs logging or enrichment, that belongs in a node whose `with` clause grants those capabilities, or in a host-side step outside this node.

